{"id": "Dfy1lX4vCMR", "title": "Video by zak.elga", "description": "Four volume profile shapes, four different trades. The shape tells you where tomorrow's move starts.\n\nWhere the volume sits = where value got built. The thin part = where price ran, and where someone should defend it next session.\n\n→ b shape: a selloff, then the volume sits low. Sellers should defend the thin area above.\n→ P shape: the mirror. A rally, then the volume sits high. Buyers should defend the thin area below.\n→ D shape: both sides agree. Fade both edges, target the POC.\n→ Long and thin: one side ran all day. Don't call the turn. Join the trend on a bounce into the last fat spot.\n\nThe shape shows you WHERE. Order flow shows you WHEN.\n\n📌 Save this before your next session (NQ, ES, any futures market).\n\nComment MAP and I'll send you the full breakdown 👇\n\n#orderflow #daytrading #futurestrading #nqfutures #volumeprofile", "channel": "zak.elga", "uploader_id": "75404542437", "uploader": "Zak Elga", "timestamp": 1794814755, "like_count": 380, "comment_count": 110, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1482667370458305a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 61.539, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://scontent-ord5-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQP0-hAJ9xx7EeIZ4KSsQxEdHzrMLP8jyGOCx6jBWnOEykXYax_eFZDlvoJ0kMn4ucizl6Pn77DDUe9nk59R-G5HgdOjRPqyYz3Cf5U.mp4?_nc_cat=109&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=57lNo2gvZO8Q7kNvwGkN-Lc&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=rYaUrq9HSkR4V8QRQIPOaA&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQS1KPDl1NVbYMH9CQJ0u8Gc37MJb9FFXXso1jra5REXNw&oe=6AFDBF96", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 61.539, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/53